#. module: purchase_stock_lot_analytic
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/purchase_stock_lot_analytic/models/purchase_order_line.py:0
msgid ""
"You must set an analytic account of plan '%(plan)s' on the line for product %(product)s "
"before confirming the order."
msgstr ""
"Debe asociar una cuenta analítica del plan '%(plan)s' a la línea del producto %(product)s "
"antes de confirmar la orden."

#. module: purchase_stock_lot_analytic
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/purchase_stock_lot_analytic/models/purchase_order_line.py:0
msgid ""
"Configure the analytic plan for lots in Purchase settings of company %s before confirming the order."
msgstr ""
"Configure el plan analítico para lotes en los ajustes de Compras de la compañía %s antes de "
"confirmar la orden."

#. module: purchase_stock_lot_analytic
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/purchase_stock_lot_analytic/models/purchase_order_line.py:0
msgid ""
"An archived lot '%(lot)s' already exists for product %(product)s. "
"Unarchive the lot or correct the analytic account before confirming the order."
msgstr ""
"Ya existe un lote archivado '%(lot)s' para el producto %(product)s. Desarchive el lote "
"o corrija la cuenta analítica antes de confirmar la orden."
